{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INDOORS</strong> is a narrative-driven escape room for PC, where you\u2019ll uncover mysteries long buried by time.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of <strong>Rebecca</strong>, a time-traveling journalist working for <i>Indoors LTD., newspaper of the paranormal and unexplainable</i>. Your latest assignment: solve the <strong>1951 disappearance of the Alston family</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to break into the mansion just an hour after the events. Gather information on the 12 suspects to uncover the real story that hides in the Alston manor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So sit back in your office, load the case slide into the projector, and prepare to see what unfolds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726 YOUR FIRST CASE: THE ALSTON FAMILY DISAPPEARANCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decades have passed since the Alston family, one of Britain\u2019s most respected households, vanished from their mansion without a trace. The case was closed when the local police lost all of the original files.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it\u2019s up to you to explore the halls of Alston Manor and search for clues that could finally reveal the truth behind the tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supposedly, the manor is empty\u2026 but you might want to check your back every now and then.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610960/extras/ed47e310a3d51dc3c8932f4c0cfe2eb8.poster.avif?t=1768377620\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610960/extras/ed47e310a3d51dc3c8932f4c0cfe2eb8.webm?t=1768377620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610960/extras/ed47e310a3d51dc3c8932f4c0cfe2eb8.mp4?t=1768377620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2726 KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner and uncover the mansion\u2019s hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snap photos of crucial evidence with your mysterious camera.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect documents, notes, and records to piece the story together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Identify the culprit among multiple suspects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time-traveling to the 1950s may have scrambled your mind!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover how this case connects to a deeper, overarching narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610960/extras/41abcbd5371ef97f2da8ef20f280958b.poster.avif?t=1768377620\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610960/extras/41abcbd5371ef97f2da8ef20f280958b.webm?t=1768377620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610960/extras/41abcbd5371ef97f2da8ef20f280958b.mp4?t=1768377620\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2610960?t=1768377620","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610960/cbf953a3e604b563a4785d1ceb17d205950103cb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768377620","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610960/b85f873a58e1e8ade1b139cc8353b3e05044e565/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768377620","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610960/b85f873a58e1e8ade1b139cc8353b3e05044e